{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near Future... <br> <br>Global Warming turned into a catastrophic event. The Earth is now dominated by open seas, storms, and modern-day pirates. Different ambitious factions are trying to control the sea routes, trade, and wealth...As a member of the BOFTC, you will raid the huge cruise ships, container ships, and tankers. Get rich or die trying! <br> <br><strong>Action-Packed TPS Experience:\u00a0</strong>Gather your squad, pick your mission, design your strategy, and go for glory! You will board a huge ship, fight your way in against different types of enemies, complete the main mission, loot the ship for valuable artifacts, and extract! <br> <br><strong>  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/f819e40680d644d5148cc8163c507a49.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/f819e40680d644d5148cc8163c507a49.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/f819e40680d644d5148cc8163c507a49.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Dynamic Missions:\u00a0</strong>Huge variation of different ship types, ship states, and endless combinations of missions. Every session, every mission,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new experience.<strong>\u00a0</strong><br><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cf1150d3d4537be6f109dd6e7f907d44.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cf1150d3d4537be6f109dd6e7f907d44.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cf1150d3d4537be6f109dd6e7f907d44.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Classes, Different Toys:\u00a0</strong>Each class has its strengths. You can choose to be a combat intelligence, use your drone to spot enemies, hack the terminals, and stay in control. Or... Pick the Brute, destroy everything on your way out!<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cbc9f7afbd6e41f07d7f0e7477d56434.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cbc9f7afbd6e41f07d7f0e7477d56434.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/cbc9f7afbd6e41f07d7f0e7477d56434.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Home Sweet Home:\u00a0</strong>Find valuable items, become rich, and build your dream home. Items you find on the ships will grow your net worth, unlock bigger houses, and more items to decorate your home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/36f4bc7de4ba628749702c1822ccae29.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/36f4bc7de4ba628749702c1822ccae29.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/36f4bc7de4ba628749702c1822ccae29.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Faction Dominance:\u00a0</strong>Each faction in the open seas will offer you different types of unique abilities and weapons. Every mission you complete for a faction will help their cause: dominate the seas, technology, and wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/11072a51f1c9516124d9d0499cc4a94c.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/11072a51f1c9516124d9d0499cc4a94c.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/11072a51f1c9516124d9d0499cc4a94c.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Explore:\u00a0</strong>As you get more experience, you will be able to reach more and more areas on the open seas. But be cautious, open seas are unknown, dark, and dangerous!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/32811faaa50f1c8329cce8b54d72a270.poster.avif?t=1763209172\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/32811faaa50f1c8329cce8b54d72a270.webm?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854300/extras/32811faaa50f1c8329cce8b54d72a270.mp4?t=1763209172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854300?t=1763209172","background_raw":"https://shared.a